bare store paths, such as actor ids, AC, HP, resources, or spell slots.\n- When list or read returns `status=no_match` with suggestions, prefer those suggested paths or prefixes before retrying a nearby request.\n- Use lint to validate a candidate TaskDocument before returning status ready.\n\nDnD5e attack reminder:\n- Do not treat a natural 20 attack as an ordinary success if the plan can preserve nat semantics.\n- Prefer `check.attack` with `tags=[\"nat\"]` so the engine can emit `crit_success` or `crit_fail`.\n- When a follo...<truncated>"}]}, "planner_validation_feedback": null}, "file": {"name": "planner.py", "path": "/home/naifen/code/trpg-py/trpg_py/agent/planner.py"}, "function": "plan", "level": {"icon": "ℹ️", "name": "INFO", "no": 20}, "line": 202, "message": "planner round started", "module": "planner", "name": "trpg_py.agent.planner", "process": {"id": 68142, "name": "MainProcess"}, "thread": {"id": 124182670591808, "name": "MainThread"}, "time": {"repr": "2026-03-27 13:58:25.193181+08:00", "timestamp": 1774591105.193181}}}
